I added `partsBySku()` to `WorkLog`, just before `get`. It skips jobs in the `dropped` state and sums `qty` per `sku` over the parts of all other jobs. The sku is used exactly as stored (I did not use the `partKey` helper), and nothing in the log or its jobs is modified.

I couldn't see the file body, so I anchored the edit on the `get(id: number): Job | undefined {` line from the outline. That line should appear only once, but the edit would be refused if it doesn't.
